<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77310" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάν-δημος</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάνδᾱμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανδήμιος</span>
			 (esp. in Prose), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					175
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					1026
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέγαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					227
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. πόλις, στρατός</span>, <i>the
				whole body of</i> the city, <i>of</i> the army, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Aj.</u>
				844
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. χάρις</span>
			<i>general</i> favour, <i><span class="en">
				Alcid.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1406a26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόξα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					31.25.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῖπνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					7.2712.79
				</span></i>
			 (Acraeph.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Sammelb.</u>
					5765
				</span></i>
			 (iii/ <span class="entity">iv A. D.</span>); of diseases, <i>pandemic</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(1).2
			</span></i>; epith. of Zeus at Athens, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1075
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μως,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανδημεί, τοὺς ἀνθρώπους
					εὐώχησε π.</span>
			 ib.<i><span class="en">
				5(2).268.43
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Mantinea</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. Ἔρως</span>
			<i>vulgar</i> love, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐράνιος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				180e
			</span></i> sq., cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				8.9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. Ἀφροδίτη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					181a
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.659
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1014.57
			</span></i> (Erythrae, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				1.22.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMeretr.</u>
				7.1
			</span></i>, etc. (also in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				97
			</span></i> bis); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐρασταί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					181e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. μουσική</span>
			<i>common, vulgar</i> music, <i><span class="en">
				Aristox.
				<u>Fr.Hist.</u>
				90
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ π. λέξις</span>
			<i>ordinary (common)</i> speech, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.165
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i></div>
